>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$10$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$12$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$15$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$w$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$25$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nIn the table above, the ratio of $q$ to $p$ is constant for each ordered pair. What is the value of $w$?"] [:db/cas 17592186208532 :question/problem "Consider the following system of inequalities:\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {\\left\\{  \\begin{array}{l}v > u + 1 \\\\ u > 8\\end{array} \\right. }\n$$\n\nWhich of the following tables contains only points $(u, v)$ that satisfy this system?\n\nI\n\n| $u$ | $v$ |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $9$ | $10$ |\n| $10$ | $12$ |\n| $12$ | $15$ |\n\nII\n\n| $u$ | $v$ |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $9$ | $11$ |\n| $10$ | $12$ |\n| $12$ | $15$ |\n\nIII\n\n| $u$ | $v$ |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $8$ | $12$ |\n| $9$ | $11$ |\n| $10$ | $12$ |\n\nIV\n\n| $u$ | $v$ |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $9$ | $11$ |\n| $8$ | $12$ |\n| $10$ | $11$ |" "Consider the following system of inequalities:\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {\\left\\{  \\begin{array}{l}v > u + 1 \\\\ u > 8\\end{array} \\right. }\n$$\n\nWhich of the following tables contains only points $(u, v)$ that satisfy this system?\n\nI\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"left\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$u$</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$v$</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$10$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$10$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$12$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$12$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$15$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nII\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"left\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$u$</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$v$</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$11$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$10$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$12$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$12$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$15$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nIII\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"left\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$u$</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$v$</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$12$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$11$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$10$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$12$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nIV\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"left\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$u$</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$v$</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$11$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$12$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$10$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$11$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n"] [:db/cas 17592186208532 :question/worked-solution "We are asked to determine which table contains only points that satisfy the system of inequalities $v > u + 1$ and $u > 8$. To do this, we check that each point satisfies both conditions.\n\nThe correct table is the following:\n\n| $u$ | $v$ |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $9$ | $11$ |\n| $10$ | $12$ |\n| $12$ | $15$ |\n\nNotice that for the points $(9, 11)$, $(10, 12)$, and $(12, 15)$, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}11 & > 9 + 1 = 10✓ \\\\ 12 & > 10 + 1 = 11✓ \\\\ 15 & > 12 + 1 = 13✓\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nand\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\begin{bmatrix}9 & > 8✓ \\\\ 10 & > 8✓ \\\\ 12 & > 8✓\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nBoth inequalities are satisfied for all points." "We are asked to determine which table contains only points that satisfy the system of inequalities $v > u + 1$ and $u > 8$. To do this, we check that each point satisfies both conditions.\n\nThe correct table is the following:\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$u$</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$v$</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$11$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$10$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$12$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$12$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$15$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nNotice that for the points $(9, 11)$, $(10, 12)$, and $(12, 15)$, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}11 & > 9 + 1 = 10✓ \\\\ 12 & > 10 + 1 = 11✓ \\\\ 15 & > 12 + 1 = 13✓\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nand\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\begin{bmatrix}9 & > 8✓ \\\\ 10 & > 8✓ \\\\ 12 & > 8✓\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nBoth inequalities are satisfied for all points."] [:db/cas 17592186208548 :question/worked-solution "To determine which table correctly matches the graph, we identify several key points directly from the plot.\n\nFrom the plot, we see the following:\n\n- At $x = 4$, the height is $y=9$ meters.\n- At $x = 3$, the height is $y=8$ meters.\n- At $x = 5$, the height is $y=8$ meters.\n\nAmong the given tables, only the table shown below contains all three of these values:\n\n| $x$ | $y$ |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $3$ | $8$ |\n| $4$ | $9$ |\n| $5$ | $8$ |" "To determine which table correctly matches the graph, we identify several key points directly from the plot.\n\nFrom the plot, we see the following:\n\n- At $x = 4$, the height is $y=9$ meters.\n- At $x = 3$, the height is $y=8$ meters.\n- At $x = 5$, the height is $y=8$ meters.\n\nAmong the given tables, only the table shown below contains all three of these values:\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$x$</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$y$</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\"><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$3$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$8$</td></tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\"><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$4$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$9$</td></tr>\n<tr><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$5$</td><td data-cell-align=\"center\">$8$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n"] [:db/cas 17592186208554 :question/problem "In a school club membership report, the counts of members by club and gender are shown in the table below.\n\n|  | Male | Female | Totals |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| Robotics Club | $44$ | $46$ | $90$ |\n| Debate Club | $27$ | $33$ | $60$ |\n| Art Club | $31$ | $39$ | $70$ |\n| Environmental Club | $78$ | $42$ | $120$ |\n| Totals | $180$ | $160$ | $340$ |\n\nWhich club has a male count that is closest to $\\dfrac{1}{6}$ of the total number of males in the report?" "In a school club membership r