e report." "From the table, we see that there is a total of $180$ males in the report.\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-border-top=\"solid\" data-border-left=\"solid\"></td>\n<td data-fill=\"#F2F4F4\" data-cell-weight=\"bold\">Male</td>\n<td data-fill=\"#F2F4F4\" data-cell-weight=\"bold\">Female</td>\n<td data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\" data-cell-weight=\"bold\">Totals</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-fill=\"#F2F4F4\" data-cell-weight=\"bold\">Robotics Club</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$44$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$46$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#EBF5FB\">$90$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-fill=\"#F2F4F4\" data-cell-weight=\"bold\">Debate Club</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$27$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$33$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#EBF5FB\">$60$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-fill=\"#F2F4F4\" data-cell-weight=\"bold\">Art Club</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$31$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$39$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#EBF5FB\">$70$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-fill=\"#F2F4F4\" data-cell-weight=\"bold\">Environmental Club</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$78$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$42$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#EBF5FB\">$120$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\" data-cell-weight=\"bold\">Totals</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#FCF3CF\">$180$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#EBF5FB\">$160$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">$340$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{1}{6}\n$$\n\nof the total number of males in the report is\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{1}{6}\\cdot 180 = 30\n$$\n\nNow compute the absolute