roduct weight | $43$ | $44$ | $45$ | $45$ | $46$ |\n\nOver this $5$-trial period, which of the following is **not** equal to $45lb$ rounded to the nearest integer?" "The product weight, in pounds $(lb)$, of a certain item was recorded across $5$ different trials.\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\">Trial</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\">$1$</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\">$2$</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\">$3$</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\">$4$</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\">$5$</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">Product weight</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$43$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$44$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$45$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$45$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$46$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nOver this $5$-trial period, which of the following is **not** equal to $45lb$ rounded to the nearest integer?"] [:db/cas 17592186209256 :question/problem "|  | Snack purchased | Snack not purchased | Total |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| Book purchased | $75$ | $30$ | $105$ |\n| Book not purchased | $40$ | $35$ | $75$ |\n| **Total** | **$115$** | **$65$** | **$180$** |\n\nOn Wednesday, a bookstore had $180$ customers. The table above summarizes whether or not customers bought a book, a snack, both, or neither. Based on the data in the table, what is the probability that a randomly selected customer did not purchase a book?" "\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\"></th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Snack purchased</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" dat