d or hourly workers.\n\n| Employment Type | Day Shift | Night Shift | Total |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| Salaried | $32$ | $8$ | $40$ |\n| Hourly | $58$ | $62$ | $120$ |\n| **Total** | **$90$** | **$70$** | **$160$** |\n\nIf one employee is selected at random, what is the probability that the selected employee is an hourly worker?" "A survey was conducted among $160$ employees at a manufacturing plant. The table below shows the number of employees who work either the day shift or the night shift, grouped by whether they are salaried or hourly workers.\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Employment Type</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Day Shift</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Night Shift</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Total</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">Salaried</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$32$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$40$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">Hourly</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$58$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$62$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$120$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"><strong>Total</strong></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"><strong>$90$</strong></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"><strong>$70$</strong></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"><strong>$160$</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nIf one employee is selected at random, what is the probability that the selected employee is an hourly worker?"] [:db/cas 17592186209261 :question/problem "In a national nutrition survey, $850$ students were asked about their breakfast habits and physical activity level. The results are shown in the table below.\n\n| Physical Activity Level | Eats Breakfast Daily | Does Not Eat Breakfast Daily | Total |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| Low | $95$ | $115$ | $210$ |\n| Moderate | $170$ | $120$ | $290$ |\n| High | $215$ | $135$ | $350$ |\n| **Total** | **$480$** | **$370$** | **$850$** |\n\nIf one of the $850$ students is selected at random, what is the probability that the student eats breakfast daily?" "In a national nutrition survey, $850$ students were asked about their breakfast habits and physical activity level. The results are shown in the table below.\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Physical Activity Level</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Eats Breakfast Daily</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Does Not Eat Breakfast Daily</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Total</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">Low</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$95$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$115$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$210$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">Moderate</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$170$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$120$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$290$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">High</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$215$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$135$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$350$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"><strong>Total</strong></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"><strong>$480$</strong></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"><strong>$370$</strong></td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\"><strong>$850$</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nIf one of the $850$ students is selected at random, what is the probability that the student eats breakfast daily?"] [:db/cas 17592186209304 :question/problem "| Score Range | Number of Students |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $50-59$ | $3$ |\n| $60-69$ | $6$ |\n| $70-79$ | $9$ |\n| $80-89$ | $10$ |\n| $90-100$ | $4$ |\n\nThe table above shows how many students scored within each range on a test. Of those students who scored at least $70$, what fraction scored at least $90$?" "\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Score Range</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Number of Students</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$50-59$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$60-69$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$70-79$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$80-89$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$10$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$90-100$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nThe table above shows how many students scored within each range on a test. Of those students who scored at least $70$, what fraction scored at least $90$?"] [:db/cas 17592186209312 :question/problem "| Age Group | Number of Members |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $0-9$ | $4$ |\n| $10-19$ | $6$ |\n| $20-29$ | $9$ |\n| $30-39$ | $10$ |\n| $40-49$ | $7$ |\n| $50-59$ | $3$ |\n\nThe table above shows how many members of a community fall within each age group. Of those members who are at least $20$ years old, what fraction are at least $40$ years old?" "\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><tab