 17592186209357 :question/problem "A survey conducted among a group of households determined whether they had high-speed internet and cable television. The results are shown in the table below.\n\n|  | Has cable TV | Does not have cable TV |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| Has high-speed internet | $14$ | $6$ |\n| Does not have high-speed internet | $12$ | $8$ |\n\nIf one of these households is chosen at random, what is the probability that it has high-speed internet but does not have cable TV?" "A survey conducted among a group of households determined whether they had high-speed internet and cable television. The results are shown in the table below.\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\"></th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Has cable TV</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Does not have cable TV</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">Has high-speed internet</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$14$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">Does not have high-speed internet</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$12$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nIf one of these households is chosen at random, what is the probability that it has high-speed internet but does not have cable TV?"] [:db/cas 17592186209358 :question/problem "The table below summarizes the number of restaurants that offer outdoor seating and provide free Wi-Fi.\n\n|  | Provides free Wi-Fi | Does not provide free Wi-Fi |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| Has outdoor seating | $16$ | $4$ |\n| Does not have outdoor seating | $11$ | $9$ |\n\nIf one of these restaurants is selected at random, what is the probability that it **has outdoor seating but does not provide free Wi-Fi**?" "The table below summarizes the number of restaurants that offer outdoor seating and provide free Wi-Fi.\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\"></th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Provides free Wi-Fi</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Does not provide free Wi-Fi</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">Has outdoor seating</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$16$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">Does not have outdoor seating</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$11$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nIf one of these restaurants is selected at random, what is the probability that it **has outdoor seating but does not provide free Wi-Fi**?"] [:db/cas 17592186209361 :question/problem "An art supply shop lists $20$ items. The table below summarizes the items by type and whether they are priced at or below $\\$12$.\n\n| Item | Priced at no more than $\\$12$ | Priced greater than $\\$12$ | Total |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| Markers | $5$ | $3$ | $8$ |\n| Paints | $8$ | $4$ | $12$ |\n| **Total** | **$13$** | **$7$** | **$20$** |\n\nIf one of the items is selected at random, what is the probability that the selected item is Paints and is priced greater than $\\$12$?" "An art supply shop lists $20$ items. The table below summarizes the items by type and whether they are priced at or below $\\$12$.\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Item</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D