tudents.\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Score</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Number of Students</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$62$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$64$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$66$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$10$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$68$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$12$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$70$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$9$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$72$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\nA new score of $40$ is added to the dataset, making $51$ scores in total. Which statement best compares the mean and median of the new dataset to those of the original dataset?"]]
